      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d067e7e9f12047c6",
      "translationZh": "多年来，JVM 一直在旁观 AI 革命。每个模型、AI 框架、每一次突破，都是基于/为 Python 构建的。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fea2db796e34c338",
      "translationZh": "jinfer 是一个从第一原则构建用于 JVM 的推理引擎：支持聊天、视觉、音频转录、嵌入、重排序和 TTS。无需 Python 运行时，无 ONNX，无 sidecar 进程，无包装层；整个栈都是为 JVM 构建的：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "478b430cd56ca0d4",
      "translationZh": "jinfer JVM 推理引擎，支持广泛的流行模型和模态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
